こうき</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>でお<ruby>酒<rp>(</rp><rt>さけ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby><ruby>飲<rp>(</rp><rt>の</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>むと、<ruby>気圧<rp>(</rp><rt>きあつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>のせいか<ruby>酔<rp>(</rp><rt>よ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>いやすい。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">Maybe it&#x27;s the low air pressure that means you get drunk more easily on planes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">器械</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きかい</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机器；机械装置；仪器；器具；装置</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"112621\"><ruby>彼<rp>(</rp><rt>かれ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はその<ruby>新<rp>(</rp><rt>あたら</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>しい<ruby>機械<rp>(</rp><rt>きかい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>試<rp>(</rp><rt>ため</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してみた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">He tried out that new machine.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">機関車</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きかんしゃ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机车；火车头</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"183347\"><ruby>機関車<rp>(</rp><rt>きかんしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>長<rp>(</rp><rt>なが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>い<ruby>貨物車<rp>(</rp><rt>かもつしゃ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>列<rp>(</rp><rt>れつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>引<rp>(</rp><rt>ひ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っ<ruby>張<rp>(</rp><rt>ぱ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>走<rp>(</rp><rt>はし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>っていた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The locomotive was pulling a long line of freight cars.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">着替え</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きがえ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">换衣服；更衣；换洗衣物</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"126596\"><ruby>着替<rp>(</rp><rt>きが</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>えをするために<ruby>家<rp>(</rp><rt>いえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>帰<rp>(</rp><rt>かえ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>った。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">I went home to change my clothes.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">飢饉</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">ききん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">饥荒；歉收；长期短缺；慢性缺乏</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"217906\">これらの<ruby>国<rp>(</rp><rt>くに</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>はしばしば<ruby>飢饉<rp>(</rp><rt>ききん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>に<ruby>襲<rp>(</rp><rt>おそ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>われた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">These countries were often visited with famine.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">効く</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きく</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n3\" href=\"../../n3/kanji/\">N3</a><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/kanji/\">N2</a><span class=\"v-m\">有效</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span class=\"lx-src\"><span class=\"t-zh\">汉字 </span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">漢字 </span><a href=\"../../n2/kanji/\" lang=\"ja\">効</a></span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">器具</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きぐ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">器具；用具；工具；仪器；器械；装置</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">期限</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きげん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">期限；期间；时间范围；期限；截止期限；截止日期</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"214481\">すべてのレポートは<ruby>期限<rp>(</rp><rt>きげん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>守<rp>(</rp><rt>まも</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>って<ruby>提出<rp>(</rp><rt>ていしゅつ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>されなければならない。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">All essays must be handed in on time.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">記号</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きごう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">符号；记号；标志</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"237582\">＆という<ruby>記号<rp>(</rp><rt>きごう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は、ａｎｄを<ruby>指<rp>(</rp><rt>さ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>す。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The sign &#x27;&amp;&#x27; stands for &#x27;and&#x27;.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">刻む</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きざむ</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">动词Ⅰ</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">動詞Ⅰ</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">切碎；剁碎；切成细末；绞碎；雕刻；刻画；凿刻；镌刻；滴答计时；打出节拍；记录流逝的时刻；铭记；深深地记在心里；留下深刻印象；刺青；纹身；折磨；使痛苦</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><s