\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">气体；蒸气；气态物质</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"211523\">その<ruby>気体<rp>(</rp><rt>きたい</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>悪臭<rp>(</rp><rt>あくしゅう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>放<rp>(</rp><rt>はな</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>つ。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">This gas gives off a bad smell.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">基地</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きち</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">基地；军事基地；根据地；迷；狂热爱好者；狂热者；痴</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"222304\">この<ruby>近<rp>(</rp><rt>ちか</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>くに<ruby>軍<rp>(</rp><rt>ぐん</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>の<ruby>基地<rp>(</rp><rt>きち</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>がある。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">There is a military base near here.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">きっかけ</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">机会；契机；开端；借口；动机；诱因；场合</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">基盤</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きばん</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">基础；根基；基石；地基；基础设施；基岩；岩床；平台</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span la