</ruby>じに。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">In the garden, you know. I&#x27;d like to put out benches and increase the customer seating. Like this ...</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">客間</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きゃくま</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">客厅；会客室；客房</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">キャンパス</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\"></span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">校园；大学校园</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"89241\"><ruby>彼女<rp>(</rp><rt>かのじょ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>私<rp>(</rp><rt>わたし</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>を<ruby>連<rp>(</rp><rt>つ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>れてキャンパスを<ruby>案内<rp>(</rp><rt>あんない</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>してくれた。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">She showed me around the campus.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div class=\"v-head\"><span class=\"v-w\" lang=\"ja\">休業</span><span class=\"v-r\" lang=\"ja\">きゅうぎょう</span></div><div class=\"v-mid\"><a class=\"lvb\" data-level=\"n2\" href=\"../../n2/vocab/\">N2</a><span class=\"pos\"><span class=\"t-zh\">名词</span><span class=\"t-ja\" lang=\"ja\">名詞</span></span><span class=\"v-m\">停业；暂停营业；临时关闭（商店、学校等）；停工；假日</span></div><div class=\"v-ex\"><span lang=\"ja\" data-tatoeba-id=\"207628\">その<ruby>店<rp>(</rp><rt>みせ</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>は<ruby>月曜日<rp>(</rp><rt>げつようび</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>には<ruby>休業<rp>(</rp><rt>きゅうぎょう</rt><rp>)</rp></ruby>です。</span><span class=\"ex-zh\" lang=\"en\">The store is closed Mondays.</span></div></li>","<li class=\"vrow\"><div cla